[/table]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Why Use MaoLib?[/h2]
[b]1. Native.[/b] No abstraction. Stack traces go directly to your code.
[b]2. Production-proven.[/b] Backbone of Lost 4 Creed (16 addons, thousands of players).
[b]3. Modular.[/b] Load only what you need. Self-contained .nut files.
[b]4. Secure.[/b] Allowlist-validated config. Leak detection. Recursion guard.
[b]5. Self-contained.[/b] No DLLs, no binaries. Drop the VPK and go.
[b]6. Documented.[/b] Every function has API docs with examples.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Installation[/h2]
[list=1]
[*] Download the VPK
[*] Place in [code]Left 4 Dead 2/left4dead2/addons/[/code]
[*] Done - auto-loads on every map
[/list]

[h3]From your scripts[/h3]
[code]IncludeScript("maolib", getroottable())
// All MaoLib namespaces available[/code]

